with respect to form."}], "Usage", CellID -> 118005], 
     Cell["expr must have top exterior degree on exactly one manifold and \
have no free tensor indices. The metric must be nondegenerate.", "Notes", 
      CellID -> 118006], Cell["Supply the form expression, including its \
indices, as the first argument. The metric determines the Hodge dual and the \
codifferential used for integration by parts.", "Notes", CellID -> 118007], 
     Cell["The implementation handles sums, scalar functions, products, wedge \
products, Hodge duals, and the supported exterior derivative and \
codifferential expressions.", "Notes", CellID -> 118008]}, Open]], 
